What are Bulletproof SUVs?
Bulletproof SUVs represent the pinnacle of armored vehicle engineering, combining rugged off-road capability with military-grade protection. These vehicles feature ballistic steel body construction, multi-layered transparent armor glass, and explosion-resistant undercarriages designed to withstand attacks from firearms, explosives, and other high-threat scenarios. Unlike standard SUVs, bulletproof models undergo extensive modifications that can increase vehicle weight by 800-1,200kg while maintaining drivability and performance.
The market serves high-profile clients including government agencies, military forces, corporate executives, and high-net-worth individuals operating in high-risk environments. Recent technological advancements have enabled manufacturers to create armored SUVs that appear nearly identical to standard models, addressing the growing demand for discreet protection among private clients.
