•	Asia-Pacific Government Contracts - Increasing defense budgets in India, China, and Southeast Asia present significant opportunities for armored vehicle suppliers.
•	Retrofit and Upgrade Services - Growing demand for periodic armor upgrades and technology refreshes creates a lucrative aftermarket segment.
